---
/**
 * String Kit tool page.
 */
import ToolLayout from '../../layouts/ToolLayout.astro';
import StringKit from '../../components/tools/StringKit';
---

<ToolLayout slug="string-kit">
  <StringKit client:load />

  <Fragment slot="about">
    <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3">
      <div class="hud-card p-5">
        <h3 class="eyebrow text-accent mb-2">01 · DOM-Based HTML Extraction</h3>
        <p class="text-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
          Uses native browser <code>DOMParser</code> to build inert trees safely without executing scripts.
          Accurately converts malformed markup, entities, and complex tables.
        </p>
        <div class="text-faint mt-3 font-mono text-[11px]">
          Filtering: Strips navbars, cookie banners, and script tags automatically.
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="hud-card p-5">
        <h3 class="eyebrow text-accent mb-2">02 · Edge-Case Resilient Transforms</h3>
        <p class="text-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
          Transforms handle unicode Base64 (UTF-8 safe), URL-safe Base64 without padding, camelCase
          acronym boundaries (<code>parseHTTPResponse</code>), and JSON escaping.
        </p>
        <div class="text-faint mt-3 font-mono text-[11px]">
          Integrity: Automated round-trip reversibility check on all invertible transforms.
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="hud-card p-5">
        <h3 class="eyebrow text-accent mb-2">03 · Transparent Output Logs</h3>
        <p class="text-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
          Reports every discarded tag, stripped container, and table degradation so you know exactly
          what was modified or retained.
        </p>
        <div class="text-faint mt-3 font-mono text-[11px]">
          Granularity: Character, byte, word, and distinct count stats.
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="hud-card border-warn mt-6 border-l-2 p-5">
      <h3 class="eyebrow text-warn mb-3">Operational Limits & Assumptions</h3>
      <ul class="text-muted grid gap-3 text-xs leading-relaxed sm:grid-cols-2">
        <li class="flex gap-2">
          <span class="text-accent font-mono font-bold">·</span>
          <span
            ><strong>Client-Rendered SPAs:</strong> Parses static source HTML; for JavaScript-rendered
            SPAs, paste the outer HTML directly from DevTools inspector.</span
          >
        </li>
        <li class="flex gap-2">
          <span class="text-accent font-mono font-bold">·</span>
          <span
            ><strong>Merged Table Cells:</strong> Tables with colspans/rowspans convert into annotated
            description lists to avoid broken Markdown pipe formatting.</span
          >
        </li>
        <li class="flex gap-2">
          <span class="text-accent font-mono font-bold">·</span>
          <span
            ><strong>ASCII Slug Decomposition:</strong> Unicode diacritics are normalized; non-Latin alphabets
            without ASCII equivalents are stripped.</span
          >
        </li>
        <li class="flex gap-2">
          <span class="text-accent font-mono font-bold">·</span>
          <span
            ><strong>Abbreviation Sentence Splits:</strong> Regex-based sentence splitters may divide
            text on periods in uncommon abbreviations.</span
          >
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </Fragment>
</ToolLayout>
